course: dictionary
lesson: 86
title: Actual: real, not guessed
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Actual means real or true. It tells you that something is not just guessed, imagined or planned. «The actual temperature» is the temperature that was really measured, not the one someone thinks it might be.
explain: In maths and science, actual separates a real measurement from an estimate. If you estimate a length as 10 cm but measure it as 12 cm, the actual length is 12 cm. You can then find the difference between the two.
explain: Actual is also used to stress the exact thing itself, as in «the actual answer». Ask yourself: is the writer saying this is the real one, not a copy or a guess? Check by swapping in the word real. If the sentence still makes sense, actual means real here.
fact: Actual means real or true, not guessed, imagined or planned.
fact: Actual is an adjective. Actually is the adverb, as in «in actual fact».
fact: An estimated length is a guess. The actual length is the length you really measure.
fact: In 1947 a real moth was found stuck in a computer, and the team wrote «first actual case of bug being found» in their logbook.
fact: Actual can stress the exact thing, as in «the actual size» of a toy on the side of a box.
exercise: «The actual temperature was lower than the weather report said.» What does actual mean here? | Imagined | Planned for later | Estimated or guessed | *Real and measured
exercise: Maya guessed the box was 20 cm long. Its actual length was 18 cm. What is the actual length? | 2 cm | 20 cm | 38 cm | *18 cm
exercise: In «check your actual screen time instead of guessing», which word shows the real number, not a guess? | *actual | screen | checking | instead
test: What does actual mean? | *Real or true, not guessed | Old and worn | Loud and noisy | Very fast
test: Ella estimated her walk was 2 km. Her app shows the actual distance was 1.8 km. Which is the actual distance? | 0.2 km | 3.8 km | *1.8 km | 2 km
exam: Which sentence uses actual to stress the exact thing itself? | The box was sold by the shop | *Show me the actual answer you wrote | The team was happy | We hope it rains today
